<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harris Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harris Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jackson Partners &amp; Associates Inc said it initiated coverage of Harris Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- expects Harris to earn $5.16 a share in fiscal 1997, $6.00 a share in fiscal 1998 and $7.20 a share in fiscal 1999.</p>
<p>-- said Harris' earnings should accelerate as a result of improved results in the semiconductor and communications sectors.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $100 a share.</p>
<p>-- Harris gained 1-5/8 to 76-1/4.</p>
</text>
